  "source_sha256": "ca86d70b898ad37b9f66389a14964c757d2ffb8dd6f04cc9f13a4c37bf85d016",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b263a7ab73217965354d0548a5f69e2bcbd1ef9532a85af6feb2492d5858bbb6",
      "text": "Wukong Plays\nin the Sand",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c23acf3352e896e817e2793765861289fcb712f5bb5605077d64586a76151334",
      "text": "Wukong had a big plan.\n“A mountain of sand!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "50acad3c24682ed02a88e39d6c8a4faf52c6d6c348c8e65fb558fbe3452aa922",
      "text": "He filled his little bucket.\nDry sand.\nTip! The sand fell flat.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3bb3b560618e0fa62ea838b52715cf964ddfb646de0628a8ff493e004a754801",
      "text": "“A hat!” said Pigsy.\n“Try it on?”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b7ea9bcc5d84d8449b4dfb7e370357c9d80e00210a3be5a30d754f8cecc7afe6",
      "text": "Ao Bing brought some water.\n“Let’s try wet sand.”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ca327ef51aea9a46659160498a375972f4e7597c2c444d32d4d89a24c053fafe",
      "text": "Glug, glug, glug.\n“Oops! Sand soup!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a3d2b73fcf7fcef8cdb9d9f9585500d0c8dd324d03acdc9c2cfc37dd9f6dcc97",
      "text": "Wukong put his bucket down.\n“Mountains are hard to make.”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3635a70d6ad8633bca4c4c79396409a540794b38ab51396d1079f986e1b2d425",
      "text": "“Let’s try again,” said Sandy.\nWukong nodded.\n“Dry sand. A little water.”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "abd72828bea058ed194876f7747123928685506b58097670ac16d9a729ebc87d",
      "text": "They mixed the wet sand.\nThey pressed it.\nIt stuck together.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "df90c2575771c5f7db739aa7cf75f478179f58dae3b9805d36dfa4102c73d881",
      "text": "Scoop, scoop.\nPat, pat, pat.\n“Ready?”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8442205c82a215c97c1a2e578e76fc305f038a1bca1cd5595a2ec753278b4276",
      "text": "They tipped the bucket.\nThey lifted it slowly.\nA tower stood tall!",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3c3565b9fba4d49c5b3a1e480758864256d3b1f526901c3a77a7020c3ab9b7e9",
      "text": "Wukong made a tiny mountain.\nPigsy made a round cake.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "cb4027e67ed089d67000bc86a1165ed812f55f72a384100e11b4bd7830dbc988",
      "text": "Ao Bing dug a little pool.\nHe poured in water.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "df086df57c725575e2f100b6b8d2d830959dc0248787270aafd7f7275e81090b",
      "text": "Pigsy asked, “Who lives here?”\n“A tiny king!” said Wukong.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f6ff3b56b011609cfa699645ecd095e8e28d0080e22af13bec9c031aa22f24f4",
      "text": "They packed the toys away.\nSandy helped brush off sand.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5dee8d7bb3ee8f7264878762e2a62dca758866deae9e485c32165a514d04be6e",
      "text": "Wukong tipped out his shoe.\n“Look! A mountain came home!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d22637ab6fc3dba430ef0766620f48df979b60ce1dd6eb422e5d1b92cb88016b",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\nThank you for reading!\nWe hope you and your little reader\nenjoyed this little adventure.\nMore free stories\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends\nRead, download and print - always free.\nRead more free stories\nIf you enjoyed our stories, you are welcome\nto help the next one grow. Support is optional.\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nCreated by Peihong Guo\nStories and illustrations made with AI assistance and human editing.\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · Attribution · NonCommercial · NoDerivatives\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
